From 9f4dcfbe92abf3ef8abc6ace03af006c5919c772 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Build <build@local>
Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 09:47:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] sched_ext: port sched_ext from scx v6.6.4-scx2

- Copy kernel/sched/ext.c and include/linux/sched/ext.h from sched-ext/scx-kernel-releases v6.6.4-scx2
- Apply scheduler integration patches (core.c, fair.c, idle.c, etc.)
- Enable CONFIG_SCHED_CLASS_EXT and CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_BTF in k1_defconfig

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
